OL,5,G0010 999: On the Front Line
OL,6,     FThe paramedics are called out to a
OL,7,     Fwoman who's had a seizure on a
OL,8,     Fbus, a man who's too weak to reach
OL,9,     Fhis oxygen supply, and a young
OL,10,     Fwoman with terminal cancer who's
OL,11,     Fcollapsed.
OL,12,G0115 24 Hours in A&E
OL,13,     FIain, who's 60, is rushed to St
OL,14,     FGeorge's after falling 10 feet off
OL,15,     Fa ladder. And 13-year-old Lucy has
OL,16,     Flost the feeling in her feet and
OL,17,     Fhands after falling off a
OL,18,     Ftrampoline.
